source: components/markdown/tests/markdown.rs
expression: body
---
<p>A table transposes when annotated:</p>
<div class="transpose transpose-bp-40rem transpose-cols-3"><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Department</th><th>Started</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><td>Ada</td><td>Platform</td><td>2021</td></tr>
<tr><td>Linus</td><td>Kernel</td><td>2019</td></tr>
</tbody></table>
</div>
<p>A table without the annotation stays plain:</p>
<table><thead><tr><th>x</th><th>y</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><td>1</td><td>2</td></tr>
</tbody></table>
